<rml>
<head>
<title>Z2 drzwi (Lua)</title>
<!--
Example (TSRE displays): z2_drzwi.rml with Lua.

Shape: PKPIC_B11mnouz-70085.sd (the IC trains' other Z2B), the same four
squares, RefreshRate 1 (drawn again every second).

The data bindings fill the texts. The script z2_drzwi.lua, called on each
redraw (the displayupdate event, its time the clock's seconds after
midnight), shows the bottom line in Polish, then in English, 4 s each.
z2_drzwi.rml does the same without Lua, by TSRE's function cycle.
-->
<script src="z2_drzwi.lua"></script>
<style>
body, div {
    display: block;
}
span {
    display: inline;
}
body {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #050302;
    color: #ff8c1a;
    font-family: Noto Sans;
}
#panel {
    position: absolute;
    left: 10px;
    top: 6px;
    right: 10px;
    bottom: 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
}
.train {
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.route {
    font-size: 40px;
}
.state {
    color: #ffb347;
    font-size: 32px;
}
.hidden {
    display: none;
}
</style>
</head>
<body data-model="display" ondisplayupdate="z2DrzwiUpdate(event, document)">
<div id="panel">
    <!-- The train's fields where it has them, else its timetable name. -->
    <div class="train" data-if="train.line != '' || train.category != '' || train.number != ''">
        {{train.category}} {{train.number}} {{train.name}}
    </div>
    <div class="train" data-if="train.line == '' &amp;&amp; train.category == '' &amp;&amp; train.number == ''">
        {{train.id}}
    </div>

    <div class="route">{{train.origin}} – {{train.destination}}</div>

    <!-- Lua shows one of these two and hides the other. -->
    <div id="pl">
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state == 'standing'">Stacja: {{train.at}} · odjazd {{train.departs}}</div>
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state == 'approaching'">Dojeżdżamy do: {{train.next}}</div>
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state == 'finished'">Koniec biegu</div>
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state != 'standing' &amp;&amp; train.state != 'approaching' &amp;&amp; train.state != 'finished'">
            Następna stacja: {{train.next}}
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="en" class="hidden">
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state == 'standing'">Station: {{train.at}} · departs {{train.departs}}</div>
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state == 'approaching'">Approaching: {{train.next}}</div>
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state == 'finished'">Terminus</div>
        <div class="state" data-if="train.state != 'standing' &amp;&amp; train.state != 'approaching' &amp;&amp; train.state != 'finished'">
            Next station: {{train.next}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
